  <h2>Understanding construction costs when hiring builders in Lucknow</h2>

  <p>One of the most common frustrations with builders and developers in Lucknow is the gap between quoted cost and final billing. This happens because many contractors quote only the grey structure cost, leaving finishes, electrical, plumbing, and site development as "extra." By the time a client realises the full scope, they've already paid the advance and switching becomes difficult.</p>

  <p>A trustworthy builder provides a complete Bill of Quantities at the outset. Every line item is specified by material grade, brand where relevant, and quantity. VP Infra's contracts follow this format. You know the total before work starts. There are no surprises. If you want to understand how construction costs are typically structured, our article on <a href="/blog/building-construction-trends-lucknow/">construction trends in Lucknow for 2026</a> covers material pricing and specification shifts in the current market.</p>

